Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.00,0:00:06.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I carry high my craven flag,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.56,0:00:12.68,Default,,0,0,0,,my ally I'm gonna fly and let my struggles\Nshoot me through the sky It'd be a pity
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.76,0:00:18.16,Default,,0,0,0,,if we lingered here And let our pretty\Nsparks of life flindle out and disappear
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.80,0:00:24.48,Default,,0,0,0,,There may be fog that even you can't\Nnavigate If someone strong like you is lost,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.56,0:00:25.84,Default,,0,0,0,,then who will set me straight?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.92,0:00:27.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause when the waves cast
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.74,0:00:30.76,Default,,0,0,0,,my heart adrift It's been your\Nkindness and your strength
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.84,0:00:34.82,Default,,0,0,0,,That would free me from\Nthe mist And just like that
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.82,0:00:41.90,Default,,0,0,0,,We move on Sail to a\Nnew dawn Weigh anchor,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.08,0:00:47.32,Default,,0,0,0,,ride as high as you can I assure I\Ndon't need anger I go fast as I am,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.40,0:00:51.06,Default,,0,0,0,,yeah I hear you laughing like\Nyou're numb to it all Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.16,0:00:54.54,Default,,0,0,0,,we're dashing together No,\Nwe're never gonna fall,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.82,0:00:58.88,Default,,0,0,0,,you know The whole world may\Nnow be my enemy What a swirl,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.08,0:01:01.68,Default,,0,0,0,,but I ain't backing down\Nso long as I'm free,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.76,0:01:06.22,Default,,0,0,0,,yeah Thought I'd give it, come\Nround the current with me All in,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.50,0:01:09.82,Default,,0,0,0,,wake up bright and early,\Nmaking for the peak we go
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.68,0:01:24.36,Default,,0,0,0,,All in, wake up bright and\Nearly, making for the peak we go
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.16,0:01:36.32,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare they publish this?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.40,0:01:39.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm with that picture, no less. Absurd.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.48,0:01:42.38,Default,,0,0,0,,We told you to remove\Nthe D and you ignored us.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.50,0:01:44.21,Default,,0,0,0,,We weren't informed, I swear.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.02,0:01:47.36,Default,,0,0,0,,We got the pictures from Tang of CP0.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.60,0:01:48.43,Default,,0,0,0,,We just thought...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.51,0:01:49.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Reprint them immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.62,0:01:50.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.94,0:01:52.66,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't let this trash get out.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.74,0:01:53.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.65,0:01:55.79,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't contact the printing company!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.12,0:01:59.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Useless idiots!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.44,0:02:03.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop them, or you'll all pay the price!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.20,0:02:11.40,Default,,0,0,0,,That photo really excites\Nthe imagination, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.58,0:02:12.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep it up, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.24,0:02:15.16,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll deliver every last copy!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.24,0:02:20.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Cypherpole infiltrated the land of water,\Nand no one's heard a peep from them since!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.60,0:02:24.62,Default,,0,0,0,,In their last transmission, they\Nsaid Big Mop's ship had arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.04,0:02:27.24,Default,,0,0,0,,The government won't\Nmanipulate this story.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.32,0:02:28.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Not on my watch!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.22,0:02:32.96,Default,,0,0,0,,When the winds of change are whipping\Nup a storm, nothing beats the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.04,0:02:34.48,Default,,0,0,0,,The news never stops!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.78,0:02:36.24,Default,,0,0,0,,It's flying full speed!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.26,0:02:44.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, what's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.86,0:02:48.08,Default,,0,0,0,,A special report? What happened? Oh, wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.40,0:02:49.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Check this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.86,0:02:55.54,Default,,0,0,0,,emperors of the sea kaido and big mom\Ndefeated news this massive could not be
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.62,0:03:01.02,Default,,0,0,0,,contained and it spread across the world\Nlike wildfire the people were clamoring to
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.10,0:03:05.78,Default,,0,0,0,,learn the names of the three pirate\Ncaptains who ended the emperor's reign and
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.86,0:03:11.72,Default,,0,0,0,,the world government was swift in their\Nplacing an exorbitant bounty on each head.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.88,0:03:16.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Three billion berries?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.36,0:03:19.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, boss! Nice, Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.82,0:03:20.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me see!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.94,0:03:22.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I have got to look at this up close!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.88,0:03:24.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Check this part out!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.24,0:03:26.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Holy crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.62,0:03:30.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, boss, where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.88,0:03:32.59,Default,,0,0,0,,He's even Pizarro than usual.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.68,0:03:34.34,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think he's running off to?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.42,0:03:36.24,Default,,0,0,0,,The flower capital, I'm sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.30,0:03:42.50,Default,,0,0,0,,We have a new emperor\Nof the sea, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.74,0:03:44.88,Default,,0,0,0,,And it's no surprise who it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.62,0:03:46.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.66,0:03:49.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard there's a banquet\Nin the capital today.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.32,0:03:50.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go tear it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.04,0:03:53.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Just in time for us to celebrate.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.14,0:03:56.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm about to let loose, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.58,0:03:59.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's festival time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.52,0:04:01.32,Default,,0,0,0,,We're ready to party.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.02,0:04:06.52,Default,,0,0,0,,This is going to be a disaster.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.60,0:04:07.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.90,0:04:11.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Add cloudier mushrooms\Nand chrysanthemum leaves,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.96,0:04:15.08,Default,,0,0,0,,a plate of gise tofu, some\Nflower-shaped lotus roots,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.30,0:04:16.86,Default,,0,0,0,,next up, cucumber salad.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.38,0:04:20.48,Default,,0,0,0,,We must not let any harm\Nbefall our honored guests.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.70,0:04:21.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Grind everything once,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.32,0:04:26.22,Default,,0,0,0,,heat it up and reshape it, then\Ntest it for poison three times.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.70,0:04:30.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I've honed these skills over decades,\Nall in service of this wondrous day.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.92,0:04:33.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Traditional cuisine fit for a shogun.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.50,0:04:35.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Please enjoy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.62,0:04:37.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.74,0:04:38.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is everyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.06,0:04:40.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha, ha, ha, ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.80,0:04:44.57,Default,,0,0,0,,A rowdy crew won't wait two hours\Nfor food, no matter how tasty.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.74,0:04:47.56,Default,,0,0,0,,A pity, since this is\Nquite the sight to behold.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.76,0:04:49.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You've done splendid work, Chef.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.12,0:04:50.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.03,0:04:53.25,Default,,0,0,0,,It sounds like the festival's starting.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.32,0:04:56.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Party time! Party time!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.48,0:04:58.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's grab that food and go!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.76,0:05:00.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Chocolate bananas!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.24,0:05:02.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Fried noodles!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.72,0:05:04.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Octopus, bulbs! Wow! Squid!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.22,0:05:06.46,Default,,0,0,0,,That's candy, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.20,0:05:12.76,Default,,0,0,0,,It is the greatest!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.36,0:05:15.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Festival! Everything's free!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.34,0:05:16.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Totally free!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.26,0:05:18.90,Default,,0,0,0,,My very first festival!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.16,0:05:20.44,Default,,0,0,0,,This is so fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.60,0:05:22.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't decide what I want to eat next!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.50,0:05:25.22,Default,,0,0,0,,There's just so much\Nawesome-looking stuff, you know!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.30,0:05:27.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, look over there! What are those?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.96,0:05:29.48,Default,,0,0,0,,They're called candy apples!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.56,0:05:30.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You eat it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.47,0:05:31.51,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like a jewel!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.36,0:05:33.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Beautiful!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.40,0:05:41.40,Default,,0,0,0,,It's sweet and sour and delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.70,0:05:44.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Fruit is good, but candy\Nfruit is a dream come true!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.78,0:05:47.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, less talking, more eating, Chopper!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.80,0:05:53.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that's tasty!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.74,0:05:58.08,Default,,0,0,0,,There's stalls with games\Nand stuff too, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.16,0:06:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Since you guys are the festival\Nexperts, can you show me some?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.08,0:06:02.64,Default,,0,0,0,,No, brah! Follow me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.72,0:06:06.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Once you've had all the food, there's\None thing you always got to try.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.80,0:06:11.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Right now, come, come, target, shoot it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.48,0:06:13.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I never miss.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.54,0:06:17.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think that's how you play.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.58,0:06:19.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, Luffy, you can't use your hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.58,0:06:20.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.49,0:06:21.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Can I try again?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.10,0:06:27.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Time for the net.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.92,0:06:29.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You're up next.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.24,0:06:31.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, I'll show you how it's done.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.02,0:06:40.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Two in one stroke!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.88,0:06:42.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, you're a real pro!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.44,0:06:44.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I wish I was as good as you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.86,0:06:48.92,Default,,0,0,0,,That sweet type doesn't\Nmake me happy, you bastards!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.96,0:06:51.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks pretty happy to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.34,0:06:54.40,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, Wano!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.02,0:06:56.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You wanna rock?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.58,0:07:00.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, it's Brook!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.10,0:07:02.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Knock him down, Brook! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.48,0:07:06.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd like to introduce you\Nall to my jam partner!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.46,0:07:09.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Wano's Pitch Perfect Princess!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.60,0:07:12.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause if you rock with the Soul\NKing, then you gotta be royalty!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.68,0:07:13.51,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.64,0:07:16.46,Default,,0,0,0,,We're serving our brother\Nowner's favorite tune!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.06,0:07:18.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Moon Princess!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.80,0:07:21.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Princess Yachty!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.22,0:07:39.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What are these? Find something of...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.10,0:07:42.32,Default,,0,0,0,,interest nico robin mr Tang you
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.40,0:07:46.96,Default,,0,0,0,,know my name what do you think of\Nmy treasure what aren't they cute
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.04,0:07:52.44,Default,,0,0,0,,My goshy dolls, they're fine. I
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.52,0:07:55.30,Default,,0,0,0,,struck a nerve you're funny mr Tang
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.38,0:07:59.76,Default,,0,0,0,,by the way this is a rather odd\Nplace for your collection isn't it
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.04,0:08:03.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I do hope you realize I was joking.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.48,0:08:06.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I suppose you might call\Nthis my secret hobby room,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.38,0:08:09.28,Default,,0,0,0,,and I was also confined\Nhere for quite some time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.00,0:08:12.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Confined?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.91,0:08:15.07,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems you're more\Nthan just a swordsmith.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.70,0:08:17.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, it's but a pastime.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.82,0:08:20.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems I have a good\Naptitude for it, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.20,0:08:28.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I never cared for\Nfestivals during my reign.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.36,0:08:31.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, who are you really?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.88,0:08:33.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.44,0:08:40.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I am the father of Kozuki Oden.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.24,0:08:43.74,Default,,0,0,0,,My name is Kozuki Sukiyaki.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.22,0:08:45.32,Default,,0,0,0,,The Shogun?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.60,0:08:47.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Does Momo know you're alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.14,0:08:48.97,Default,,0,0,0,,He doesn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.05,0:08:50.21,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'll keep it that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.30,0:08:54.59,Default,,0,0,0,,But I have a feeling my son's retainers\Nhave figured out who I am by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.42,0:09:00.08,Default,,0,0,0,,At any rate, I'm the one responsible\Nfor the tragedy that befell this land.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.84,0:09:07.14,Default,,0,0,0,,i'm too ashamed to tell anyone that i'm\Nalive when i emerged from this room barely
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.22,0:09:10.18,Default,,0,0,0,,clinging to life odin was dead and my
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.26,0:09:14.98,Default,,0,0,0,,beloved home was in\Nruins i felt such remorse
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.06,0:09:17.48,Default,,0,0,0,,i thought to slip my belly on the spot
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.56,0:09:23.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Still I had no choice but to hide. I had a
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.14,0:09:25.72,Default,,0,0,0,,mission to carry out i could not fail my
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.80,0:09:31.20,Default,,0,0,0,,country again but now\Nthe land of wano is free
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.28,0:09:37.82,Default,,0,0,0,,and for that i owe my deepest gratitude to\Nyou and your friends well i think they'd
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.90,0:09:39.56,Default,,0,0,0,,be very happy if you told them that in
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.64,0:09:44.78,Default,,0,0,0,,person i see that aside\Nthere's something else
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.86,0:09:49.24,Default,,0,0,0,,i need to ask you about i've been informed\Nthat this country has an ancient weapon
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.32,0:09:50.78,Default,,0,0,0,,pluton
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.86,0:09:55.96,Default,,0,0,0,,how
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.04,0:09:57.98,Default,,0,0,0,,did you
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.06,0:10:00.02,Default,,0,0,0,,know that it's written
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.10,0:10:02.69,Default,,0,0,0,,on the poneglyph in\Nthe kingdom of Alabasta
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.86,0:10:10.96,Default,,0,0,0,,i never imagined you'd know of\Nsuch a thing but yes it's here
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.94,0:10:30.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't know when to\Nquit. You guys aren't even
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.30,0:10:34.64,Default,,0,0,0,,captains if i lose to you i'll\Nbe a walking this is a damn
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.72,0:10:37.48,Default,,0,0,0,,mess and the navy doesn't\Nhave the manpower to clean it
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.56,0:10:40.80,Default,,0,0,0,,up but it looks like you were\Nworth fighting after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.90,0:10:43.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Wouldn't want you starting trouble later.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.90,0:10:54.42,Default,,0,0,0,,This is weak booze if I've ever tasted it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.56,0:10:57.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Should have expected that from\Na weak-ass crew like yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.96,0:11:01.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.87,0:11:03.25,Default,,0,0,0,,This is - Listen, it's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.34,0:11:07.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Send a warship to the land\Nof Wano. What? Ryo Kugyu?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.40,0:11:10.44,Default,,0,0,0,,And don't squeal the\NSakazuki, either. Got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.30,0:11:14.66,Default,,0,0,0,,No offense, boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.96,0:11:15.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I still like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.10,0:11:19.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Especially the way you never cut corners.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.02,0:11:25.82,Default,,0,0,0,,If I break some rules,\NI know you won't mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.66,0:11:28.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause I'm bringing you this kid's head.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.14,0:11:36.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, up there! Who is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.26,0:11:40.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Time for a toast, I see!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.60,0:11:42.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Is he gonna make a speech?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.66,0:11:45.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Ninja's pirates, minx, and samurai!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.16,0:11:47.52,Default,,0,0,0,,The shogun's retainers!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.68,0:11:49.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Yakuza and the people of Wano!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.98,0:11:52.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys really kicked some ass out there!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.48,0:11:53.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You said it, pal!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.66,0:11:54.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoever you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.66,0:11:55.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll drink to that!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.92,0:11:58.44,Default,,0,0,0,,This guy's the king of the banquet! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.76,0:12:00.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm king of the banquet!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.54,0:12:02.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.12,0:12:06.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell the land of\NWano about me, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.40,0:12:08.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What? Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.80,0:12:10.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Because it'd make me a hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.48,0:12:11.84,Default,,0,0,0,,And what's wrong with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.92,0:12:13.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the one who defeated Kaido.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.84,0:12:15.12,Default,,0,0,0,,The people need to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.20,0:12:16.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be dumb.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.38,0:12:18.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Wano has been waiting\Nfor you, Momo, not me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.42,0:12:22.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out of my way! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.06,0:12:24.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.02,0:12:27.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm taking you out right now, Taggy!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.32,0:12:29.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Fireworks ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.46,0:12:30.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.22,0:12:34.48,Default,,0,0,0,,A toast to good food every single day!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.40,0:12:38.23,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.31,0:12:39.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.90,0:12:42.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.58,0:12:44.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Cheers!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.22,0:12:52.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to show him how to party!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.18,0:13:02.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps another bottle is in order.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.86,0:13:04.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Time for a feast!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.42,0:13:07.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Empty those cups and fill them up again!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.62,0:13:09.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't stop till done!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.06,0:13:11.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Pirates know how to celebrate.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.06,0:13:13.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll say that much.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.28,0:13:18.06,Default,,0,0,0,,In all my futures, I've never\Nbeen to a banquet like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.66,0:13:26.32,Default,,0,0,0,,This victory, this moment shared with\Nfriends, will stay with me forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.48,0:13:32.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not here to have a\Ntoast with you, dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.84,0:13:35.16,Default,,0,0,0,,And why come to the\Nparty in the first place?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.24,0:13:37.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess you haven't been keeping\Nup with the news overseas, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.98,0:13:39.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, see this?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.22,0:13:42.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to take you out\Nwhile they still have a shot!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.06,0:13:48.89,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.88,0:13:55.04,Default,,0,0,0,,The news that shocked the world came\Nas quite a surprise to Luffy as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.12,0:13:56.88,Default,,0,0,0,,It was a moment that marked the end of the
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.96,0:13:59.44,Default,,0,0,0,,old regime and the beginning of a new era.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.52,0:14:03.94,Default,,0,0,0,,A shift in power left four\Ninfluential pirates in the spotlight.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.54,0:14:07.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Buggy the Genius Jester.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.64,0:14:10.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Blackbeard Teach.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.66,0:14:14.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Redhead Shanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.04,0:14:20.90,Default,,0,0,0,,And after his victory, Straw Hat Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.36,0:14:25.42,Default,,0,0,0,,The four of you are the\Nnew emperors of the scene.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.98,0:14:39.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounds like they're having a lot of fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.86,0:14:43.86,Default,,0,0,0,,But the Navy didn't come here to\Ndance to your tour, little shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.24,0:14:46.72,Default,,0,0,0,,The party's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.84,0:14:52.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna bleed all of you dry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.52,0:15:02.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You've turned the whole\Ndamn world upside down.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.82,0:15:07.02,Default,,0,0,0,,So I'll be taking your head\Nas a means of an apology.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.42,0:15:40.24,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been a long time, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.16,0:15:47.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I haven't seen this country\Nsince I bid farewell to Odin.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.64,0:15:54.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Momo and Hiyori must\Nbe all grown up by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.94,0:16:06.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone is here
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.74,0:16:10.68,Default,,0,0,0,,And they're sneaking into Wano.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.38,0:16:20.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Is something wrong, ma 'am?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.48,0:16:36.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Such a foreboding presence.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.60,0:16:37.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Something's out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.16,0:16:38.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Shinobu!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.92,0:16:41.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You felt it too?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.34,0:16:43.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I know not what it is,\Nbut it draws closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.96,0:16:45.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone, listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.50,0:16:50.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir Luffy and the others are still\Nrecovering from their battle injuries.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.60,0:16:52.80,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't let them know about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.78,0:17:04.50,Default,,0,0,0,,So Yucar noticed too, I see Do not let\Nthe sounds of the festival stop Let us go
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.02,0:17:18.28,Default,,0,0,0,,The thing about influence is
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.90,0:17:21.28,Default,,0,0,0,,When you want it
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.16,0:17:25.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It just slips away.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.74,0:17:40.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, I only have business\Nwith Straw Hat Luffy, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.60,0:17:45.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you just step aside, samurai?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.04,0:17:47.18,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a marine!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.64,0:17:49.30,Default,,0,0,0,,They've come for Sir Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.62,0:17:52.86,Default,,0,0,0,,They're the enemy of pirates,\Nbut how did one get here?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.60,0:17:54.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.80,0:17:56.92,Default,,0,0,0,,So you know about the outside world.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.72,0:18:01.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I can still teach\Nyou a thing or two.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.32,0:18:05.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Flower Capital!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.56,0:18:17.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Shinobu! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.50,0:18:22.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Kappa style!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.20,0:18:30.76,Default,,0,0,0,,River of retribution
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.74,0:18:35.78,Default,,0,0,0,,What a pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.92,0:18:49.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You're testing my patience. Stand down.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.30,0:19:02.94,Default,,0,0,0,,The celestial dragons are the gods\Nof the world. And since the land
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.02,0:19:09.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Of Wano chooses to live outside their\Nrule. Its people have no rights.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.88,0:19:14.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Rizo. We can't let him go.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.00,0:19:18.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Groves of wrath
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.14,0:19:46.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I have the power of the\Nwoods-woods fruit, a woodsman!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.98,0:19:56.30,Default,,0,0,0,,the forest is the cradle of life just\Nlike the sea it's the very essence of
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.38,0:19:59.98,Default,,0,0,0,,logia get in my way and i can kill you
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.06,0:20:03.36,Default,,0,0,0,,all without a second\Nthought the government
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.44,0:20:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,doesn't protect you because to the
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.28,0:20:11.46,Default,,0,0,0,,rest of the world what did you say how
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.54,0:20:15.98,Default,,0,0,0,,dare you speak that way about our people\Nmankind has always divided itself and
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.06,0:20:21.50,Default,,0,0,0,,chosen who to label as inferior you can\Nthink of it this way the sacrifice of
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.58,0:20:28.08,Default,,0,0,0,,the few is what guarantees the beasts\Nof the many unaffiliated countries like
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.16,0:20:32.40,Default,,0,0,0,,yours have no choice but to accept your\Nsuffering when the rest of the world
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.48,0:20:38.20,Default,,0,0,0,,looks down on you it reaffirms their worth\Nas humans discrimination creates comfort
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.60,0:20:43.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't blame me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.90,0:20:45.55,Default,,0,0,0,,This is how the world works!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.40,0:20:55.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Try and stop me!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.96,0:21:02.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You're dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.12,0:21:05.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll kill thousands of\Nyou insects if that's
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.32,0:21:07.67,Default,,0,0,0,,what it takes to get destroyed on Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.32,0:21:11.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything you say is disgusting!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.82,0:21:13.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I've heard enough out of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.26,0:21:34.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's the hold-up?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.94,0:21:36.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go see Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.70,0:21:38.64,Default,,0,0,0,,He's come far enough, hasn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.30,0:21:40.83,Default,,0,0,0,,He's one hell of a pirate.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.00,0:21:43.54,Default,,0,0,0,,He really did it, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.94,0:21:56.30,Default,,0,0,0,,That's strong Haki.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.78,0:21:59.22,Default,,0,0,0,,This country has suffered for 20 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.46,0:22:03.08,Default,,0,0,0,,On this day, they celebrate a freedom\Nthey fought tooth and nail for.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.16,0:22:04.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't let you spoil it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.52,0:22:06.99,Default,,0,0,0,,And who the hell are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.14,0:22:08.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Yamato.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.48,0:22:09.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the son of Kaido.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.04,0:22:12.52,Default,,0,0,0,,He has a child.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.94,0:22:14.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Well spoken, my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.76,0:22:17.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Momonosuke.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.62,0:22:21.74,Default,,0,0,0,,The heroes who saved this\Ncountry deserve their rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.82,0:22:24.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I will make certain they\Nhave it. The dragon?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.42,0:22:29.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Black breath!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.28,0:22:41.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Be careful, my lord!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.78,0:22:43.82,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.46,0:22:48.36,Default,,0,0,0,,If you must fight, do it\Naway from the capital!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.70,0:22:50.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You will not trouble my people!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.02,0:22:54.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I made a promise to\Nthem and I will keep it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.52,0:22:55.64,Default,,0,0,0,,A pink dragon?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.00,0:22:58.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never heard of a devil\Nfruit power like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.60,0:23:00.43,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.28,0:23:16.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Yamato, please, step\Nback from this battle!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.04,0:23:30.84,Default,,0,0,0,,We should be coming up on water real soon!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.44,0:23:32.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.12,0:23:33.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.03,0:23:35.02,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't land there.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.16,0:23:40.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but I'm just\Nnot ready to see Usam.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.56,0:23:44.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, bet that little bastard\Nkid is still there too.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.14,0:23:48.40,Default,,0,0,0,,He picked a fight with us once,\NI'm sure he'll do it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.48,0:23:49.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Relax, would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.84,0:23:51.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave it to the boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.40,0:23:53.58,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no point in fighting over it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.18,0:24:01.22,Default,,0,0,0,,That power...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.08,0:24:21.98,Default,,0,0,0,,you're kidding that's\Nred-haired shanks they've
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.06,0:24:25.26,Default,,0,0,0,,got some cp-9 agents on\Nboard huh what a pain
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.80,0:24:30.08,Default,,0,0,0,,don't worry let's go
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.52,0:24:35.35,Default,,0,0,0,,FIRE!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.43,0:24:36.80,Default,,0,0,0,,WE NEED TO HOLD SHIPS BACK!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.94,0:24:45.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.85,0:24:47.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would they be targeting us?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.52,0:24:48.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What do they want?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.94,0:24:51.52,Default,,0,0,0,,We're not carrying any treasure with us!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.76,0:24:53.54,Default,,0,0,0,,All we have is a Devil Fruit.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.24,0:24:57.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Do they want stupid\Nrubber powers that bad?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.52,0:25:15.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You better start taking me seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.38,0:25:18.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll prove how tough I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.74,0:25:21.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.65,0:25:22.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.70,0:25:28.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.14,0:25:30.26,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.54,0:25:34.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on a sec, Luffy. Come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.70,0:25:41.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.36,0:25:42.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm stretching!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.84,0:25:44.06,Default,,0,0,0,,What the heck?!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.64,0:26:04.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Get lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.20,0:26:10.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.64,0:26:11.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop crying.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.92,0:26:13.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a man, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.80,0:26:15.88,Default,,0,0,0,,But, Jinx, your arm!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.94,0:26:18.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Your arm!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.76,0:26:28.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess all the top guys know Straw\NHat Luffy from back in the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.96,0:26:31.34,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of pirate do you think he is?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.76,0:26:34.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I've heard Straw Hat Luffy\Nis totally out of control.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.50,0:26:37.54,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a violent monster like\Nan ape in human clothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.62,0:26:38.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.60,0:26:40.13,Default,,0,0,0,,We're gonna go, aren't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.54,0:26:43.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't need to see Luffy yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.20,0:26:48.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides, think about what's\Nbeen going on in our territory.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.84,0:26:51.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You're talking about our Jolly\NRoger getting burned, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.58,0:26:53.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What was that guy's name?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.12,0:26:56.18,Default,,0,0,0,,He said he was Luffy's underling\Nand replaced our flag with his.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.26,0:26:57.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.30,0:26:59.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy's gonna be king of the pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.80,0:27:01.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Take this free sticker to support him.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.88,0:27:05.08,Default,,0,0,0,,But this is Shanks' territory,\Nand he's an emperor of the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.16,0:27:06.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Screw that!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.62,0:27:13.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care about no damn emperor!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.82,0:27:15.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a reputation to uphold.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.22,0:27:17.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't just let it slide.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.98,0:27:20.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, sure, that's one way to look at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.28,0:27:23.69,Default,,0,0,0,,But on the other hand, we'd\Njust be saying hi to a friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.92,0:27:25.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobody would ever know.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.24,0:27:33.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't let the Revolutionary Army\Nget away with this anymore, Akainu.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.12,0:27:38.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd love to stomp them out, but we\Ndon't have enough troops to deploy.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.74,0:27:40.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Sabo.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.65,0:27:43.51,Default,,0,0,0,,He's become their hero, and\Nnow the whole world knows.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.42,0:27:48.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Nefertari Cobra was the sole king\Nat the Reverie descended from
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.16,0:27:52.40,Default,,0,0,0,,the first 20 who created the\Nworld government 800 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.48,0:27:55.36,Default,,0,0,0,,As far as symbolic victories go,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.58,0:27:59.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think the Revolutionary Army\Ncould have asked for a better outcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.56,0:28:02.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Hours before the assassination,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.48,0:28:05.54,Default,,0,0,0,,in the land of the gods where\Nthe world nobles reside,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.62,0:28:10.12,Default,,0,0,0,,the Revolutionaries declared war by\Ndestroying the hoof of the Celestial Dragon,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.20,0:28:12.10,Default,,0,0,0,,a symbol of divine rulership.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.64,0:28:16.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Admirals Ryokugyu and Fujitora\Nled the Navy forces into battle,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.82,0:28:18.02,Default,,0,0,0,,but the enemy escaped.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.10,0:28:22.34,Default,,0,0,0,,And then, they freed the former\Nrevolutionary Bartholomew Kuma,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.58,0:28:25.64,Default,,0,0,0,,who had been enslaved by\Nthe Celestial Dragons.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.74,0:28:29.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm, a stunning loss.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.96,0:28:33.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Must have been hard for the admirals\Nto fight in the Land of the Gods.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.86,0:28:36.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's not make excuses\Nfor them. They failed.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.30,0:28:40.62,Default,,0,0,0,,The report says Princess\NVivi is nowhere to be found.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.94,0:28:44.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Went poof, around the same\Ntime as her father's murder.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.36,0:28:46.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Not sure if the two cases are related.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.58,0:28:47.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll look into it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.94,0:28:51.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Alabasta must be hurting right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.34,0:28:54.34,Default,,0,0,0,,King Cobra's ship is still\Nsitting at the Red Port.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.68,0:28:58.45,Default,,0,0,0,,They can't even send it home\Nthanks to all the madness going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.00,0:29:01.86,Default,,0,0,0,,What about the attempted\Nmurder of Saint Charles?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.94,0:29:03.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Are we closing the case on that one?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.94,0:29:08.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, Saint Mjosgard has been accused\Nof letting the assailant escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.18,0:29:10.98,Default,,0,0,0,,They're deliberating over the\Nmatter in the land of the gods.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.06,0:29:14.94,Default,,0,0,0,,The Holy Knights have intervened\Nand it's turned into a huge mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.20,0:29:20.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Not our problem. Let them\Nfigure it out in each
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.34,0:29:23.52,Default,,0,0,0,,case the public is\Nconvinced that sabo was the
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.60,0:29:25.68,Default,,0,0,0,,one pulling the strings\Nthis caused quite a
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.76,0:29:29.06,Default,,0,0,0,,stir as you might guess\Nhe's a popular man in the
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.14,0:29:31.50,Default,,0,0,0,,lands that were part of\Nthe eight nation revolution
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.58,0:29:34.38,Default,,0,0,0,,sparks of rebellion are starting fires all
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.46,0:29:37.90,Default,,0,0,0,,over the world and to the\Ntraders sabo is a hero
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.98,0:29:41.76,Default,,0,0,0,,they worship him like\Nsome kind of god they've
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.84,0:29:45.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Even started calling him\Nthe Flame Emperor. He's
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.02,0:29:49.02,Default,,0,0,0,,become so popular he's\Neven overshadowed the
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.10,0:29:52.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Revolutionary Army's leader,\Nthe insurgent serpent.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.36,0:29:57.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Dragon on top of all that,\NSabo's little brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.44,0:30:01.36,Default,,0,0,0,,is Straw Hat luffy how\Ncute they're both emperors
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.44,0:30:04.88,Default,,0,0,0,,the flame emperor will strike down the old
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.96,0:30:07.04,Default,,0,0,0,,regime just like his\Nbrother did in the world
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.12,0:30:10.62,Default,,0,0,0,,of pirates, this is the\Nbeginning of a new era.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.58,0:30:23.10,Default,,0,0,0,,what a mess picked a hell of\Na time to be fleet admiral
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.48,0:30:29.86,Default,,0,0,0,,fine you bastards can\Ndo your worst i won't
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.94,0:30:33.44,Default,,0,0,0,,lose no matter how many of you come at me
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.92,0:30:37.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.50,0:31:10.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, Beck, it's time.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.10,0:31:15.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I think we're ready to go for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.16,0:31:23.62,Default,,0,0,0,,The One Piece.
